{"id":"vod_bf_44418","vodId":"44418","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"玉子市场","name_cn":"玉子市场","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/1cf4c7c647604bbce982c669f2368620.jpg"},"summary":"在一座远离大都会吵闹喧嚣的平凡小镇，不甚兴旺的兔子山商业街内，生活着一群可爱有趣的人。故事的女主角北白川玉子（洲崎绫 配音）是当地饼店“玉屋”的长女，她性格活泼随和，擅长制作饮食，与对门面饼店“大路屋”的儿子大路饼藏（田丸笃志 配音）是一对青梅竹马，不过两家的爸爸是典型的同行冤家，彼此一见面便战火不断。这一日，玉子在花店意外发现一只会说话的鸟（山崎巧 配音）。鸟自称来自南方，肩负着神秘使命。鸟的到来自然为玉子和周边人的生活增添不少乐趣，而快乐浪漫的青春校园生活又令人心驰神往。　　围绕着情人节、祭祀以及部团活动，兔子山商业街平凡而有趣的故事交替上演……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:12:19","classic":true,"classicRank":49,"franchise":"玉子市场","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuzishichang/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:17.115Z"}